%rec: OpeningBranch

cond: IsActorInCombatWithPlayer(NPC)
goto: Combat

cond: HasFlag('lenny_met')
goto: Again

cond: true
goto: Intro

%rec: Nodes
%type: npc multiline

name: Combat
npc: Take it! Take all of it, it was never mine!
effect: EndConversation

name: Intro
npc: (A thin man in three coats looks up from a pile of Jacob Thorne's shirts.)
+ Place was empty. Door was open. That makes it mine, way I see it.
+ You want something, or you want to buy something? He left a lot behind.
effect: SetFlag('lenny_met')
#
o_text: Show me what Jacob left.
o_id: lenny_trade
o_effect: StartTrading
o_goto: Again
#
o_text: This was Jacob's place. Get out.
o_id: lenny_evict
o_test: RollSkill('intimidate', 'Easy')
o_succ: Evicted
o_fail: StaysPut
#
o_text: What happened to his boys?
o_id: lenny_thugs
o_goto: Thugs
#
o_text: Keep it. Nobody else wants it.
o_id: lenny_leave
o_goto: Bye

name: Again
npc: Back for more of the dead man's stuff?
#
o_text: Let's see it.
o_id: lenny_trade_again
o_effect: StartTrading
o_goto: Again
#
o_text: What happened to his boys?
o_id: lenny_thugs_again
o_goto: Thugs
#
o_text: Later.
o_goto: Bye

name: Thugs
npc: Still out there. Nobody pays them now, so they help themselves to whoever walks past.
+ I keep the door shut and the lights off. You should keep your head down.
#
effect: ReturnToPreviousNode

name: Evicted
npc: (He is already stuffing shirts into a bag.) Alright, alright. Keep the furniture.
effect: SetFlag('lenny_evicted')
effect: RemoveActor('squatter_lenny')
effect: EndConversation

name: StaysPut
npc: Jacob's dead, choomba. Dead men don't need rooms and you don't look like his heir.
#
o_text: Fine.
o_goto: Bye

name: Bye
npc: (He goes back to sorting a dead man's shirts.)
effect: EndConversation
